url: "https://ata381.github.io/BibMedEd/"
abstract: >-
  BibMedEd is an open-source platform that unifies bibliographic search,
  deduplication, bibliometric analysis, and methodology logging for
  medical-education research. It replaces a fragmented workflow across
  PubMed, Covidence, VOSviewer, CiteSpace, and Excel with a single
  self-hostable application and an extensible adapter system for
  arbitrary bibliographic data sources.
